## 📊 SCALABILITY ROADMAP

### Phase 1: Current State (Single Instance)
- ✅ MongoDB for data storage
- ⚠️ In-memory state (not scalable)
- ⚠️ Redis optional (should be required)

### Phase 2: Horizontal Scaling (2-5 instances)
- [ ] Redis required for all state
- [ ] Distributed session storage
- [ ] Leader election for singleton tasks (✅ already implemented!)
- [ ] Load balancer (Nginx/AWS ALB)

### Phase 3: Microservices (5+ instances)
- [ ] Separate AI service
- [ ] Separate analytics service
- [ ] Separate webhook processor
- [ ] Message queue (RabbitMQ/Kafka)

### Phase 4: Global Scale
- [ ] Multi-region deployment
- [ ] Database sharding
- [ ] Read replicas
- [ ] CDN for global content delivery

